# TRAQ Project Rules

## AI Context
This repository contains a specialized AI skill in `traq-ai-skill/`.
Always refer to `traq-ai-skill/SKILL.md` for the Master API Specification.
Always refer to `traq-ai-skill/references/best-practices.md` for architectural standards.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React + TypeScript (in `client/`)
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express (in `server/`)
- **Style**: Vanilla CSS (prefer explicit composition)

## Development Workflow
- Follow the multi-user data isolation model described in `SKILL.md`.
- All API requests must be scoped to the authenticated user via Bearer Token.
- Use `traq-ai-skill/templates/snippet.js` for example API interactions.
